2. Lemma 2 by brute force
  6577 (system, r) cases with H_(n-r) succeeding and H_n failing; violations of Lemma 2: 0
  failed decoder runs with NO mistake (human's own run also fails): 5191
  -> Theorem 3(a)'s step 'on a failed run |M_t| >= 1' needs the standing assumption that the
     human's own run succeeds on every problem; the note never states it as an assumption.
